            <title>[IGNITE-4201] CPP: fix versioning of C++ libs</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4201</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Currently  versions are not set properly in Ignite C++ core libraries names if we build this libraries on Linux according to $IGNITE_HOME/platforms/cpp/DEVNOTES.txt.&lt;/p&gt;

